{
    "_note": "Scenarios for E4-01 (purchase registration). Dates are relative to `hoy` in America/Bogota. Thresholds come from the niveles rule in reglas-validas.json (Plata 500, Oro 1.500, Diamante 3.000). The calculation follows the E3-04 assumptions still pending client confirmation (TODO(cliente)): base = floor(monto / moneda_por_punto) × puntos_por_unidad, only the highest bonus applies, caps trim the bonus points first. Transaction and movement fields use the database column names. Customers and purchases are identified by tipo_documento and documento (CLAUDE.md 3.10); when a case leaves tipo_documento out it is CC.",
